cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Forgetting and replay in a deployed SmolVLA"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hajizada
    given-names: Elvin
version: "1.4"
date-released: "2026-11-10"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/elvinhajizada/adaptive-vla-replay"
abstract: >-
  The released SmolVLA LIBERO checkpoint is taught five new LIBERO-90 tasks in sequence with its own
  fine-tuning recipe, with and without random replay of its own training data at budgets from 0.2%
  to every frame, and with the 2% budget split by task length. Code, launchers, per-run results and
  the report.
keywords:
  - vision-language-action
  - continual learning
  - experience replay
  - LIBERO
  - SmolVLA
